# Local database queries (RustMaxx)

- **Connection string**: Lives only in **`.env`** at repo root (`DATABASE_URL=`). Copy from Railway → Postgres → Connect / Variables. Do **not** commit `.env` or paste full URLs into chat.
- **Inspect data** (read-only guard):  
  `npm run db:query -- "SELECT id, email, role, signup_interested_server_owner, signup_interested_streamer, signup_interested_fan FROM users LIMIT 20"`
- **Mutations** require explicit `--write`:  
  `npm run db:query -- --write "UPDATE users SET ... WHERE ..."`
- Uses `scripts/db-query.ts` (`dotenv/config` + `pg`), same pattern as `npm run migrate`.

When the user wants DB-driven fixes, prefer running these commands in the terminal so results stay on their machine unless they paste summaries.
